sequenceDiagram
  title Store: a purchase within a signed limit
  participant V as Quillfern's visiting representative
  participant D as Brightwick Outfitters host representative
  V->>D: greeting
  D-->>V: greeting
  V->>D: card_presentation
  D-->>V: host card, card_receipt
  V->>D: introduction, vouch null
  V->>D: invitation_request: order.place, up to 100.00 USD
  D-->>V: grant: pass for order.place, up to 100.00 USD
  Note over V,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  V->>D: act order.place 40.00 USD
  D-->>V: act_result ok
  V->>D: act order.place 80.00 USD
  D-->>V: act_decision deny, SEAT_SCOPE_EXCEEDED (would go past the 100.00 USD limit)
  V->>D: farewell
